### VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client. Copy returned IDs below.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@contactId = replace-with-contact-id
@itemId = replace-with-item-id

### 5. Create contact
POST {{base}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"Анна Иванова","email":"anna@example.com","telephone":{"mobile":"+7 900 123-45-67","home":""}}

### List contacts
GET {{base}}/api/contacts

### Read one
GET {{base}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}

### Full update
PUT {{base}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"Анна Петрова","email":"anna@example.com","telephone":{"mobile":"+7 900 222-33-44","home":""}}

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"new@example.com"}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}

### 6. Prism: example from OpenAPI
GET http://127.0.0.1:4010/api/contacts

### 7. GraphQL create
POST {{base}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"mutation($input: CreateItemInput!) { createItem(input: $input) { id text qty completed userId } }","variables":{"input":{"text":"Молоко","qty":2,"userId":"student-1"}}}

### GraphQL list
POST {{base}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"query($userId: ID!) { items(userId: $userId) { id text qty completed userId } }","variables":{"userId":"student-1"}}

### GraphQL select only one field
POST {{base}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"query($id: ID!) { item(id: $id) { text } }","variables":{"id":"{{itemId}}"}}

### GraphQL update
POST {{base}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"mutation($id: ID!, $input: UpdateItemInput!) { updateItem(id: $id, input: $input) { id qty completed } }","variables":{"id":"{{itemId}}","input":{"qty":3,"completed":true}}}

### GraphQL delete
POST {{base}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"mutation($id: ID!) { deleteItem(id: $id) }","variables":{"id":"{{itemId}}"}}

### 8. HTTP gateway -> real gRPC server
POST {{base}}/rpc/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Хлеб","qty":1,"userId":"student-1"}

### gRPC list through gateway
GET {{base}}/rpc/items?userId=student-1

### gRPC get through gateway
GET {{base}}/rpc/items/{{itemId}}

### gRPC update through gateway (explicit false is supported)
PATCH {{base}}/rpc/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"completed":false,"qty":2}

### gRPC delete through gateway
DELETE {{base}}/rpc/items/{{itemId}}
